{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/326329-has-there-been-any-change-to-the-books-yet","id":326329,"title":"has there been any change to the books(yet?)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-30T15:33:51-08:00","id":326329,"title":"has there been any change to the books(yet?)","content":"So, I have a copy of Hero and Demigod, and I've been meaning to pick up God, but it seems impossible to track down. I've been out of the loop for awhile as well and it seems that onyx path now has publishing rights. But I can't find any details on whether or not the actual content has been changed at all. Like I said, currently I only need a copy of God, and it would suck if a second edition is out already of an already hard to find series.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2454-kyris","name":"Kyris","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T16:04:37-08:00","id":326361,"title":"","content":"The second edition is still in development, the new system (also to be used in <b>Trinity Continuum</b>) is in the works.<br /> <br /> You can get <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/54227/Scion-God\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: God</a> right now in PDF and a variety of POD formats. If you want the original printing with mixed matt and gloss cover, try online retailers like Amazon and nobleknight.com.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T16:45:51-08:00","id":326406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Craig Oxbrow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/326329-has-there-been-any-change-to-the-books-yet?p=326361#post326361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The second edition is still in development, the new system (also to be used in <b>Trinity Continuum</b>) is in the works.<br /> <br /> You can get <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/54227/Scion-God\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: God</a> right now in PDF and a variety of POD formats. If you want the original printing with mixed matt and gloss cover, try online retailers like Amazon and nobleknight.com.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sweet! I actually found that drivethrurpg offers both the PDF and hardcover as a bundle for pretty cheap, so I was planning on going through there. I don't care as much if its the original printing with matt and gloss so much as the content is the same, would be a PITA to order it and find out its the new one that doesn't work with the edition of Hero and Demigod I have, ya know?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2454-kyris","name":"Kyris","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T22:46:33-08:00","id":338737,"title":"","content":"Do we know if second edition will continue the 3 book necessity (good ol White-Wolf obnoxiousness) or just make a good sized core book?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T03:37:14-08:00","id":338920,"title":"","content":"Define &quot;necessity.&quot;<br /> <br /> Scion is actually going to be moving to four books. Origins is going to cover the core rules and low-level urban fantasy (pre-Visitation Scions and assorted other critters), and then the original trio building off of that. So you only need 3+ books if you're aiming for the higher divine tiers of play. The lower power tiers are supposed to be flushed out enough that they'll play fine without having to move past them if you don't want to.<br /> <br /> I'm really not sure how obnoxious this is. Scion 2e isn't some sort of 20th Edition super tome that's going to justify 500+ pages per core book. Asking for Demigod to work without Origins or Hero seems... kinda silly. The amount you'd have to reprint would be a far bigger slap in the face of the people that plan on getting the four core books, than it would be to the seemingly quite small group of people that want to be able to run Demigod along without anything else.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T04:07:58-08:00","id":338926,"title":"","content":"In addition, they intend to use the space they're freeing up by dropping the super-long opening fics and having Origins cover the core rules to give everything a good going-over, and add more pantheons, more powers, and coverage of tier-specific subjects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T11:48:44-08:00","id":341033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/326329-has-there-been-any-change-to-the-books-yet?p=338926#post338926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In addition, they intend to use the space they're freeing up by dropping the super-long opening fics and having Origins cover the core rules to give everything a good going-over, and add more pantheons, more powers, and coverage of tier-specific subjects.</div> </div> </div> </div>This, this, this! I approve of this. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2910-gideonhelmsley","name":"GideonHelmsley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}